# CityOS HELM — Plugin Registration
# 
# CityOS plugins are Rails Engines loaded by OpenProject's plugin system,
# not Bundler path gems. They are copied to /app/modules/ and registered
# via `bundle exec rake openproject:plugins:register` at build time.
#
# The omniauth gems needed by the identity plugin are already bundled
# in OpenProject's upstream Gemfile — do not re-declare them here.
